      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the overview. i guess i'm just wondering why certain groups think it should be in the school at all. like, is there a specific reason or logic behind the idea that kids *need* this information in a classroom setting rather than just at home? i'm trying to understand the \"pro\" side better so i can make sense of it.",
